Note on the environment and datasets: this license covers the source code and
original written content in this repository only. Training is performed
against the CartPole-v1, MountainCar-v0, and Acrobot-v1 environments from the
Gymnasium library (MIT licensed, Farama Foundation); no third-party dataset is
redistributed. dataset/cartpole_transitions.csv is generated locally by
export_dataset.py from live environment rollouts under the fixed seeds in
configs/default_config.json and is fully regenerable; see dataset/DATA_CARD.md.
